Q39: In one sentence, what is IQ data?
---
IQ data is a complex representation of a radio signal consisting of two real-valued components, In-phase (I) and Quadrature (Q), which together allow for the complete reconstruction of the signal's amplitude and phase at any given point in time.<|im_end|>
